    "closed": false,
    "dateLastActivity": "2026-11-09T23:12:03.456Z",
    "desc": "## Lore:\n\n**“I will pierce you through!”**\n\n**The Stand of Hato Higashikata. A Stand integrated into the user’s footwear that allows for the hardening and elongation of the heels. These spikes possess immense piercing power, capable of penetrating stone and allowing the user to anchor themselves to walls and ceilings.**\n\n---\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6ab51c003805e563b51e43f7/previews/6ab51c003805e563b51e4507/download/image.webp)\n\n## Pose:\n\n![image\\_2026-10-27\\_224400219.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6ae11b20e0c72072acc7d76a/previews/6ae11b21e0c72072acc7d868/download/image_2026-10-27_224400219.webp)\n\n---\n\n## M1 Light Combo & M2 Attack\n\n![m1m1m1m1m1m1m1m.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6ab54cf77a422081ed1313a8/previews/6ab54cfc7a422081ed13182a/download/m1m1m1m1m1m1m1m.gif)\n\n##\n\n## Spike Extension\n\n**Extend your heels to reach higher surfaces and enable wall and ceiling movement.**\n\n**With your heels extended, you can walk on walls and ceilings. Watch which way you are facing as you move around an edge.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 24s**\n\n![spikes.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6ab51c8f90ee981fec3466b2/previews/6ab51c9290ee981fec346991/download/spikes.gif)\n\n![wallwalk.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6ab52bd0be303a4c02317dd5/previews/6ab52bd8be303a4c0231899b/download/wallwalk.gif)\n\n## Heel Barrage\n\n**Rapid-fire kicks with spiked heels.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 23s**\n\n![barrage.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6ab52c2d37964aa82e42e82d/previews/6ab52c3137964aa82e42eeef/download/barrage.gif)\n\n## Spike Creation / Charge Stomp [HOLD]\n\n**Stomp the ground to create a field of deadly spikes. (The spike can then be grabbed and thrown.)**\n\n**VARIATION: Charge Stomp [HOLD]**\n\n**Base cooldown: 28s**\n\n## Base Variant:\n\n![base.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6acabd1ecfc13ff64acf33bc/previews/6acabd20cfc13ff64acf3468/download/base.gif)\n\n## Held Variant:\n\n![chargestomp.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6acabd09a10f93217d5beaae/previews/6acabd0ea10f93217d5bee05/download/chargestomp.gif)\n\n## Size Difference:\n\n![image\\_2026-10-11\\_003316269.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6acabd2cc7f2ae725d65e8d2/previews/6acabd2dc7f2ae725d65e9d0/download/image_2026-10-11_003316269.webp)\n\n## Ground Impale\n\n**Target an opponent near your aim to raise a ground spike and impale them. Aims within 14 studs of the cursor; if no target is found, chooses the closest opponent within 10 studs of you. The strike position is fixed when activated, so opponents can jump or dash away during startup. Breaks guards, but can be perfect blocked by facing the incoming spike.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 12s**\n\n![impales.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6acabdab5b318f6b91d7da4e/previews/6acabdae5b318f6b91d7dc82/download/impales.gif)\n\n---\n\n# EX [Awakening Moves]\n\n## Stomp EX [3 Bars]\n\n**Stomp the ground and erupt a field of spikes in front of you. (All erupted spikes can be thrown.)**\n\n**Base cooldown: 45s**\n\n![BASS.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6acabe1655eebfd957563835/previews/6acabe1b55eebfd95756441c/download/BASS.gif)\n\n## Fully Charged:\n\n![CHARGEEE.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6acabe04ace8a1b662f6c3e0/previews/6acabe08ace8a1b662f6c67c/download/CHARGEEE.gif)\n\n## Size Difference: (Charged on left)\n\n![image.webp](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6acabe2a4dc80a278c2ceb79/previews/6acabe2b4dc80a278c2cec90/download/image.webp)\n\n## Impale EX [3 Bars]\n\n**Extend your heel to impale up to three opponents, carry them outward, and pull them back. Inflicts bleed for 4 seconds. Breaks guard, but can be parried. A miss retracts faster.**\n\n**Base cooldown: 28s**\n\n![impaleex.gif](https://trello.com/1/cards/6ab435404fdc1f886a54eb74/attachments/6acabe9dd4cfdabbbfaf2f01/previews/6acabe9fd4cfdabbbfaf3344/download/impaleex.gif)",
